.TH SLDGRIDY 1 "2026" "sldgridy" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sldgridy \- editor for single-line electrical diagrams
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sldgridy
.RI [ file ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sldgridy
draws single-line diagrams for photovoltaic systems, transformer stations
and low-voltage distribution boards in a CAD-style environment working in
millimetres, and prints or plots them up to A0.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/sldgridy/
User block library and frame templates.
.TP
.I /usr/share/sldgridy/
Shipped symbol library and frame templates.
.SH LICENSE
GPL-3.0-or-later.
